<title>UK: Seafield says been approached by two parties.</title>
<headline>Seafield says been approached by two parties.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seafield Resources Plc said in a statement on Monday it had received unsolicited approaches from two parties which might lead to an offer for the company.</p>
<p>However, Seafield said it had not received any formal proposals.</p>
